problem_statement:
Possible to write/update with read_only=ON and not a SUPER privilege

Accoring to cluster_log the the node become writeable
{noformat}
timestamp mariadb is not read_only!
{noformat}

Suspect: wsrep_read_only_option that was removed in commit d54bc3c0d but has reappeared in Galera4 commit.
